<title>JAPAN: Asano Slate corrects 95/96 group net loss.</title>
<headline>Asano Slate corrects 95/96 group net loss.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asano Slate Co Ltd said on Monday it had corrected its group net loss for the 1995/96 business year to 383 million yen from a loss of 308 million yen announced on Friday.</p>
<p>The slate manufacturer also announced on Friday that it had posted a group net loss of 573 million yen for 1996/97.</p>
